; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	   106                   to this function. Review has shown that the read/write index of the deque dynamic data is initialized
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	   107                   to zero and afterwards only changed by functions Os_DequeIdxIncrement, Os_DequeIdxDecrement and
; ..\BSW364\Os\Implementation\Os_Deque.c	   108                   Os_DequeDelete which guarantee that the index is kept in valid range.
